02:08.580 --> 02:10.250
Wow.

02:12.660 --> 02:15.900
That's Katagiri-san, from the Football Association.

02:16.450 --> 02:17.660
Katagiri-san.

02:18.420 --> 02:20.200
Oh, it's you.

02:20.200 --> 02:22.900
What are you doing here?

02:23.640 --> 02:26.980
I can't imagine you coming here to see Hyuga off.

02:26.980 --> 02:29.980
I am just waiting for my flight.

02:33.740 --> 02:34.740
Here comes Hyuga.

02:41.270 --> 02:44.260
Don't you have to go interview him?

02:44.740 --> 02:47.630
Wakabayashi established his reputation in Germany.

02:47.630 --> 02:50.780
Ohzora is currently in the process of signing with Cataluña.

02:50.780 --> 02:55.400
Now, Hyuga is headed to FC Piemonte in Italy.

02:55.400 --> 03:00.200
The success of the players who earned the title in International Junior Youth at France

03:00.200 --> 03:01.780
is truly remarkable.

03:02.750 --> 03:05.680
This will be the third player headed to Europe.

03:05.680 --> 03:08.780
Will Hyuga Kojiro prevail in Italy?

03:09.310 --> 03:12.740
They're heading where success is not guaranteed.

03:12.740 --> 03:17.150
He's not the only one walking this thorny path.

03:17.150 --> 03:21.620
They all have to improve and produce results.

03:21.620 --> 03:26.220
