05:55.500 --> 05:59.900
 -Italy- Turin

06:06.940 --> 06:09.840
Who's this oriental guy?

06:09.840 --> 06:10.540
Let me see.

06:11.240 --> 06:12.630
Oh, geez.

06:12.630 --> 06:13.970
Don't you know?

06:13.970 --> 06:16.910
That's Kojiro Hyuga from Japan!

06:16.910 --> 06:18.910
Kojiro Hyuga?

06:18.910 --> 06:21.700
A Japanese player is coming to Piemonte?

06:22.300 --> 06:25.000
You're pretty conservative, aren't ya?

06:25.800 --> 06:28.440
So, is this guy any good?

06:28.440 --> 06:32.180
There's no way our team would sign anyone who isn't.

06:32.740 --> 06:34.960
Are you sure?

06:34.960 --> 06:39.700
Our Piemonte is a powerhouse that has won many Italian League titles.

06:40.150 --> 06:42.880
We're the top team in the league.

06:42.880 --> 06:48.020
A Japanese player is just going to get crushed there.

06:48.020 --> 06:52.220
Our team is filled with rowdy players.

06:52.220 --> 06:54.380
He won't secure a starting position.

06:55.190 --> 06:58.130
But I have a hunch 

06:58.130 --> 07:00.900
that Hyuga will make something happen.

07:02.140 --> 07:04.540
He's not going to make anything happen.

07:15.450 --> 07:19.430
Tsubasa... I'll be fighting in this European battleground, too!

07:20.780 --> 07:22.780
We're almost there.

07:41.580 --> 07:45.300
Piemonte Stadium

07:46.220 --> 07:47.900
Let's go.

07:48.810 --> 07:49.980
Okay.

08:01.920 --> 08:06.260
It makes you appreciate their rich history in soccer, doesn't it?

08:08.260 --> 08:12.260
You'll be the first Japanese player to join this club.

08:12.680 --> 08:16.780
Starting now, you'll have to carve your own path.

08:22.230 --> 08:25.030
I'll just be myself, no matter where I am.

08:38.230 --> 08:40.500
This is the locker room.

08:41.260 --> 08:44.340
I've been told your locker is in the back.

08:56.170 --> 08:59.620
Big names from all over the world are lined up here.

09:11.180 --> 09:14.940
I've joined their ranks.

09:22.710 --> 09:25.080
Come on, quit fooling around!

09:32.410 --> 09:35.290
Hyuga-kun, this is your schedule for today.

09:35.290 --> 09:38.260
First, you'll have a medical exam, then...

09:38.260 --> 09:39.130
Matsumoto-san.

09:39.130 --> 09:39.660
What?

09:39.660 --> 09:41.150
Where's the training field?

09:58.960 --> 10:01.620
Let's take a break, Willem.

10:03.440 --> 10:05.580
What? You guys are finished already?

10:06.010 --> 10:10.320
You'll get out of shape if you don't practice more!

10:10.320 --> 10:12.650
It's still before the training camp.

10:12.650 --> 10:14.780
You're just practicing too hard.

10:16.280 --> 10:19.350
It doesn't look like we'll get any scoops today.

10:19.350 --> 10:20.060
Hey...

10:29.910 --> 10:30.860
Hyuga-kun.

10:30.860 --> 10:33.810
You just got here. Do you really have to practice now?

10:33.810 --> 10:36.590
I've already warmed up.

10:36.590 --> 10:40.070
I'm not so weak that I get tired from a long flight.

10:40.770 --> 10:45.860
My battle to win the scoring title here began a long time ago! 

10:47.710 --> 10:48.860
Did you hear that?

10:48.860 --> 10:50.380
He's winning the scoring title! 

10:50.870 --> 10:52.740
You're Hyuga, right?

10:52.740 --> 10:53.900
The Japanese? 

10:55.380 --> 10:58.740
Did you come all the way to Italy just to watch us play?

11:04.060 --> 11:06.820
You're Willem-san of the Dutch national team, right?

11:06.820 --> 11:10.500
Are you challenging me to a duel by making me angry?

11:11.840 --> 11:13.590
You got that right.

11:13.590 --> 11:20.500
Let's see how well you Japanese play soccer.

11:20.790 --> 11:21.740
Bring it on!

11:23.780 --> 11:26.200
This is starting to get interesting!

11:26.200 --> 11:27.130
Yeah.

11:31.130 --> 11:32.420
Hyuga-kun...

11:48.060 --> 11:49.930
All right, Hyuga.

11:49.930 --> 11:54.620
Just how effective <i>is</i> your Japanese soccer versus our European soccer?

11:54.620 --> 11:57.060
Show it to us.

11:57.060 --> 11:58.400
All right.

11:59.060 --> 11:59.700
Here I come!

12:01.690 --> 12:02.560
Hyuga!

12:02.560 --> 12:05.220
Just try to score a goal!

12:05.220 --> 12:07.020
I'll do just that!

12:07.020 --> 12:08.750
Looks interesting.

12:08.750 --> 12:10.980
Why don't we join them?

12:15.180 --> 12:17.420
Come on. What's wrong?

12:17.420 --> 12:19.420
Hyuga! Pass it over here!

12:21.670 --> 12:23.220
What's up, Hyuga?

12:23.220 --> 12:25.180
You can't get past me by yourself?

12:25.180 --> 12:26.190
What did you say?

12:26.190 --> 12:27.340
Hyuga!

12:28.180 --> 12:29.190
Aren't you getting the ball?

12:29.190 --> 12:30.200
Go forward!

12:30.200 --> 12:31.180
All right!

12:35.060 --> 12:36.500
The goal is mine!

12:42.380 --> 12:43.290
What?

12:43.290 --> 12:44.860
He's already caught up?

12:56.050 --> 12:58.380
How can you let your chance slip?

12:58.870 --> 13:01.740
Or was that the limit of your soccer?

13:01.740 --> 13:03.060
What?!

13:03.060 --> 13:04.980
Don't just stand there!

13:04.980 --> 13:06.060
We're going another round!

13:09.540 --> 13:10.790
Hyuga!

13:10.790 --> 13:12.950
Try to take the ball away from me!

13:12.950 --> 13:14.420
Damn it.

13:14.420 --> 13:16.940
This bastard's looking down on me.

13:22.060 --> 13:22.580
C'mon!

13:32.660 --> 13:34.020
Damn.

13:35.620 --> 13:37.450
Come on. I'm right here.

13:38.620 --> 13:42.680
That Willem is all worked up again.

13:49.700 --> 13:51.940
What's the matter, Hyuga?

13:53.710 --> 13:56.180
This guy... what incredible endurance.

13:57.920 --> 14:02.660
He doesn't even look like he broke a sweat after moving so much.

14:04.320 --> 14:05.420
Hyuga.

14:05.420 --> 14:07.940
Is this all the soccer you got?

14:07.940 --> 14:09.250
What did you say?

14:10.460 --> 14:14.460
Or are you just slow from jet lag?

14:16.200 --> 14:18.150
Let's finish this.

14:18.810 --> 14:20.060
Don't underestimate me!

14:32.190 --> 14:34.700
Not bad.

14:37.420 --> 14:39.100
Take this!

14:45.700 --> 14:47.180
You bastard!

14:47.180 --> 14:49.060
Learn to play fair!

14:49.060 --> 14:54.580
You're not going to make it on the world stage if you lose your balance so easily!

14:54.580 --> 14:57.460
Train yourself up, then try again.

14:57.580 --> 14:59.460
What did you say?

15:01.560 --> 15:03.140
Hyuga-kun!

15:03.740 --> 15:04.620
You little...

15:06.140 --> 15:07.660
Hey, stop!

15:08.050 --> 15:09.140
Hyuga-kun!

15:09.140 --> 15:09.950
Stop.

15:09.950 --> 15:10.890
Stop it!

15:10.890 --> 15:12.670
Stop, Hyuga-kun!

15:13.660 --> 15:15.240
Let go.

15:15.240 --> 15:16.660
Let me go!

15:17.490 --> 15:20.660
Who would've thought such a weakling would come to Piemonte?!

15:20.660 --> 15:22.420
Shut the hell up!

15:27.450 --> 15:30.020
He sure made <i>something </i>happen!

15:30.020 --> 15:34.370
Can you believe that he already had a scuffle with the aggressive Willem?

15:34.370 --> 15:36.020
He looks promising!

15:36.020 --> 15:41.340
Not many people can pick a fight with him during their first appearance on the field.

15:41.340 --> 15:45.420
Hyuga Kojiro sure looks like he can make something happen, doesn't he?

15:47.340 --> 15:48.940
So?

15:48.940 --> 15:51.710
Do you feel like cheering him on now?

16:13.380 --> 16:16.380
Willem's one big troublemaker, isn't he? 

16:16.990 --> 16:19.050
Such a fierce guy.

16:19.050 --> 16:24.060
Well, it was Hyuga's fault to show up announced, too.

16:24.650 --> 16:28.430
He got a European greeting.

16:29.620 --> 16:35.130
Willem was part of the Dutch team that just got eliminated from the International Cup prelims.

16:35.130 --> 16:37.860
He must be frustrated right now.

16:38.300 --> 16:42.380
You just became the national team's coach, and it looks like it's a publicity nightmare.

16:42.380 --> 16:44.810
You're also a Dutch national.

16:44.810 --> 16:47.490
Don't say it like it doesn't involve you.

16:47.490 --> 16:51.990
How's Bernhardt and Albert?

16:53.360 --> 16:57.770
The training camp hasn't started yet, but they're already training hard by themselves.

16:57.770 --> 17:02.310
Let's hope they can focus their 
frustrations on the Spanish League.

17:02.310 --> 17:06.370
Nothing can bring you down, can it?

17:08.550 --> 17:09.250
So?

17:09.250 --> 17:12.370
I'm assuming you didn't call me today just to whine.

17:12.370 --> 17:14.060
Yeah.

17:14.060 --> 17:16.420
About the test game we talked about...

17:16.850 --> 17:20.910
Japanese Football Association's Katagiri seems to be very interested.

17:21.620 --> 17:22.570
I see.

17:23.380 --> 17:29.310
He told me he wanted us to gather our best players, as a condition.

17:30.540 --> 17:33.310
Oh, our best players?

17:34.540 --> 17:38.590
That's an interesting proposition.

17:42.380 --> 17:44.160
Hey, Bernhardt.

17:44.160 --> 17:47.900
Did you hear about the Japanese national team vs. the Dutch national team?

17:48.410 --> 17:51.900
The Japanese national team vs. the Dutch national team?

17:51.900 --> 17:53.750
I heard about it.

17:53.750 --> 17:55.900
What are you going to do?

17:55.900 --> 17:57.020
Me?

17:57.660 --> 17:59.900
I'll participate if the rumor's true.

17:59.900 --> 18:01.710
It may be an invitational game,

18:01.710 --> 18:04.900
but there's going to be a lot of international attention for a game against Japan.

18:05.300 --> 18:10.140
It's a chance for me to show off my skills to the world as a Dutch player.

18:10.790 --> 18:14.380
The result will be obvious if we're playing against Japan.

18:14.950 --> 18:21.260
What was the Japanese Football Association thinking when they set up such a game?

18:21.840 --> 18:26.780
I don't care what they were thinking as long as we can show ourselves off.

18:26.780 --> 18:30.460
I'm sure Willem is going to say the same thing.

18:30.460 --> 18:31.880
Probably.

18:33.000 --> 18:35.500
Edward gave you this article, right?

18:35.500 --> 18:40.190
Our coach is probably just instigating us, judging from his personality.

18:41.700 --> 18:42.920
Who knows?

18:45.220 --> 18:47.140
Yo, Tsubasa.

18:47.140 --> 18:50.980
You've been training until this late, rookie?

18:50.980 --> 18:54.000
I just couldn't wait to play soccer here.

18:55.740 --> 19:00.540
And it's not like the team's lineup has already been decided.

19:00.540 --> 19:03.820
I want to do everything I can.

19:03.820 --> 19:08.830
Albert, it looks like Tsubasa wants to show what he's made of, just like you.

19:08.830 --> 19:12.220
Tsubasa is Japanese, just like Hyuga.

19:12.770 --> 19:13.940
Hyuga?

19:14.990 --> 19:17.460
Here you go. Did you see this article?

19:20.860 --> 19:22.100
Hyuga-kun...

19:23.460 --> 19:27.300
Hey, Tsubasa. You know this Hyuga guy well, right?

19:27.800 --> 19:31.820
He got into a scuffle with Willem immediately after joining Piemonte.

19:31.820 --> 19:35.820
He must really have confidence in himself.

19:36.820 --> 19:43.540
Hyuga-kun is a player who never backs down, no matter who he's up against.

19:51.890 --> 19:53.960
What a joke!

19:53.960 --> 19:59.470
I thought a Japanese player who came to Italy would be tough,

19:59.470 --> 20:01.060
but you're not a big deal!

20:01.060 --> 20:02.570
What?!

20:02.570 --> 20:06.580
Japan's soccer level must be really low!

20:06.580 --> 20:09.600
Did you just make fun of my friends?

20:09.600 --> 20:11.960
I'll never forgive you for this!

20:12.820 --> 20:16.660
You're lucky you won't be playing against me in the league!

20:16.660 --> 20:18.300
You should appreciate your luck!

20:18.300 --> 20:21.330
I can say the same thing to you!

20:21.330 --> 20:28.060
Japan only gets to play because you're hosting the International Cup!

20:28.060 --> 20:30.300
You don't even have any talent!

20:30.300 --> 20:32.400
Stop acting so big!

20:35.090 --> 20:35.980
Damn!

20:37.740 --> 20:41.610
Willem... just you watch.

20:43.020 --> 20:48.260
Assuming we really are playing the game, can you get Bernhardt and Albert to play?

20:48.620 --> 20:52.560
There's a chance Tsubasa will be picked for the Japanese team.

20:52.560 --> 20:57.740
Don't you think it would be a great opportunity to see his skills in a real game?

20:59.620 --> 21:02.560
Oh, you're heading back?

21:02.560 --> 21:03.780
Yes.

21:03.780 --> 21:07.300
So, are you used to living in Spain yet?

21:07.300 --> 21:11.300
Yeah, I'm itching to play a game here.

21:11.300 --> 21:12.470
I see.

21:13.370 --> 21:18.530
By the way, a game between the Netherlands and Japan is being planned.

21:18.530 --> 21:19.840
Have you heard about it?

21:20.600 --> 21:21.670
Yes.

21:21.670 --> 21:24.660
I've heard of the rumors.

21:27.640 --> 21:31.130
I would love to play when it happens.

21:33.510 --> 21:38.580
The Dutch play risky offensive soccer.

21:38.580 --> 21:44.660
I'm also curious how the Japanese team will play against such an opponent.

21:45.620 --> 21:48.620
Yes, I can't wait.

21:49.400 --> 21:52.620
A real game against the Netherlands before training camp.

21:52.620 --> 21:57.100
Let's see what the Brancos playmaker is made of.

